          "Agile combines iterative and incremental delivery. Our guide to [iterative and incremental development](/project-management/iterative-and-incremental-development/) explains both ideas. The spectrum gives you a better question than \"Agile or Waterfall?\": how much of this project is known, and how much can be delivered in parts?",
